	the GitHub runner, CPU line: fma 1) is the FMA build; mla / mls below are those fused operations, emulated
	exactly. Checked: with mla / mls as plain a * b + c the vectors give 6 sin, 2 cos, 18 tan, 1 asin, 2 acos and
	3 atan2 mismatches, with the fused forms none. branred.c is built without FMA (config-cflags-nofma).
	NaN results follow x86-64 (default NaN 0xfff8000000000000, a NaN argument passed through).
	Only + - * /, math.abs and bit access are used; no host transcendental function.
